    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Land your drone upon a mysterious island and search for the device. Confined to your lack of resources, the drone has a very limited skillset. With no video feed, you are forced to experience your surroundings through pictures. Find the artifact, retrieve it, avoid the guardian, and return home alive.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A small open world littered with glimpses into the island's past to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A blend of First Person and Dronelike gameplay </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A chilling story told through the environment </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062080/extras/0d9329244ce73d10f81a38a9e2fcb3eb.avif?t=1744838638\" width=800 height=800 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Land your drone upon a mysterious island and search for the device. Confined to your lack of resources, the drone has a very limited skillset. With no video feed, you are forced to experience your surroundings through pictures. Find the artifact, retrieve it, avoid the guardian, and return home alive.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A small open world littered with glimpses into the island's past to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A blend of First Person and Dronelike gameplay </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A chilling story told through the environment </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062080/extras/0d9329244ce73d10f81a38a9e2fcb3eb.avif?t=1744838638\" width=800 height=800 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Vault is a spooky, atmospheric exploration game. Uncover the story of a mysterious island through the lens of a primitive drone as you search for the artifact concealed within it, and avoid the guardian of the island.",
